+# T1 — task branch names
+
+reuse: slug_of (lib/names.sh) makes the slug; branch-name.sh does not compute one. Searched
+bin/ and lib/ for anything that already builds a branch name or checks a task id: nothing
+does, so bin/branch-name.sh is new.
+
+AC-1.1, AC-1.2 evidence, tier T2 (the real script and library): `bash tests/branch-name.test.sh` → rc=0
+```
+ok - 1: a task's branch name
+ok - 2: its slug is slug_of's
+ok - 3-4: an empty title is refused with exit 2
+ok - 3-4: an empty title prints no name
+ok - 5-6: a title with no letter or digit is refused with exit 2
+ok - 5-6: a title with no letter or digit prints no name
+ok - 7-8: an id not shaped T<n> is refused with exit 2
+ok - 7-8: an id not shaped T<n> prints no name
+```
